SUMMARY:HXD Week: 1929 Allen Parkway Headquarters Tour
DTSTAMP:20260805T053732Z
DTSTART:20260805T160000Z
DESCRIPTION:The Confidential Headquarters Project is a new ground-up\, Clas
	s A Office Building located at 1929 Allen Parkway. The project has 9 occup
	iable floors and a 5-level podium parking garage. The interiors scope feat
	ures amenities such as a full-service commercial kitchen & coffee bar\, co
	nferencing center\, terrace\, and fitness center with upscale locker rooms
	. The 8 workplace floors are dedicated to workstations\, private offices\,
	 and business support\, and an executive suite with a monumental stair. HO
	K is the building designer with PDR designing interior amenities and workp
	lace. Project completion will be August 2026. \nPhotography is strictly pr
	ohibited. \nLight bites and beverages (non-alcoholic) will be provided. \n
	Parking: Validated onsite garage parking available. Tour will begin on Lev
	el 06\n\nhttps://architecturehouston.org/event/confidentialtour/\n\nFrom A
	IA Houston
URL:https://architecturehouston.org/event/confidentialtour/
LOCATION:Private: 1929 Allen Parkway\, 1929 Allen Parkway\, Houston\, TX\, 
	77019\, United States
