UID:8JfzWdjX6f7L43M5pKKzU
SUMMARY:HXD Week: BCG Houston LEED Platinum Tour
DTSTAMP:20260805T053732Z
DTSTART:20260806T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:The tour of the newly certified LEED Platinum BCG Houston offic
	e will showcase design and sustainability strategies used to create the ne
	w workspace adjacent to Discovery Green. Light bites will be provided as B
	CG and HOK’s design and sustainability team host the tour and discuss stra
	tegies that were used to achieve LEED integration\, including optimization
	 for daylight and views\, energy and water efficiency\, and enhanced waste
	 management. The design team will also walk through the space showcasing h
	ow the cohesive material palette tells a story of biophilia\, branding\, a
	nd local BCG culture while playing off the views and nature that the build
	ing overlooks. \nAIA Credit: 1.0 HSW \nLight bites will be provided. \nPar
	king:\nPaid street parking and parking garage available\; $15 flat fee par
	king in garage available.\n\nhttps://architecturehouston.org/event/bcgtour
	/\n\nFrom AIA Houston
URL:https://architecturehouston.org/event/bcgtour/
LOCATION:Private: BCG Houston\, 1550 Lamar St.\, Suite 1200\, Houston\, TX\
	, 77010\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:aia-houston
CATEGORIES:AIA Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
